{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n在最新一集《香港連場好戲》中，有份演出電影《九龍城寨之圍城》的伍允龍，與賴慰玲（Winki）、黎諾懿一同重返九龍寨城公園。當走入《九龍城寨光影之旅》展覽時，伍允龍感觸良多，彷彿坐上時光機，究竟是甚麼場景讓他如此不捨？\n</p>\n<h2>伍允龍重遊故地 讚場景神還原</h2>\n<p>今晚（14日）播出的節目焦點落在昔日的「三不管」地帶九龍寨城公園，如今該處已成為旅客遊覽的熱點。賴慰玲與黎諾懿跟隨伍允龍的腳步，走入展覽中神還原的電影場景，包括「士多」、「跌打館」及狹窄的巷弄街道，瞬間回到舊日的城寨時空。伍允龍指拍攝時已覺得場景搭建得非常逼真，好像有一種坐時光機回到80年代的感覺。</p>\n<h2>「王九」伍允龍爆心聲：有啲唔捨得</h2>\n<p>作為《九龍城寨之圍城》的演員之一，伍允龍對這些場景感受最深，他坦言：「自己拍完呢部戲，突然間拆咗之後係有啲唔捨得，可以返嚟呢個展覽，見返啲景還原，係好得意。」能夠再次見到電影中的場景被一一重現，讓他感到非常特別和懷念，彷彿所有拍攝時的回憶都湧上心頭。</p>\n<h2>賴慰玲黎諾懿瘋狂打卡 大讚髮廊細節</h2>\n<p>面對如此逼真的場景，三人亦忍不住化身遊客，在展覽內瘋狂打卡拍照留念。當他們走到「髮廊」場景時，更被當中的細節所震撼，大讚製作團隊的心思，無論是陳設還是道具都做得非常好，讓他們完全沉浸在昔日的城寨氛圍之中，體驗了一趟難忘的光影之旅。</p>\n<h2>網民期待再睹城寨風采：回憶返哂嚟</h2>\n<p>節目播出後，不少網民都表示對展覽充滿興趣，紛紛留言表示：「王九！好掛住你呀！」、「睇完戲再睇展覽，一定好有feel！」、「伍允龍講得好啱，真係好似返咗去以前咁」、「個展覽好似好正，想去打卡！」、「多謝節目帶我哋重溫城寨嘅感覺」。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_11507986426af7eb168110f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/02_11507986426af7eb168110f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_21033371296af7eb24d72e6.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/03_21033371296af7eb24d72e6.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_14886516906af7eb2db19ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/04_14886516906af7eb2db19ef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2024314676af7eb7db4b80.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/10_2024314676af7eb7db4b80.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_8784063406af7eb3d8840d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/05_8784063406af7eb3d8840d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_11835068026af7eb475ac11.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/06_11835068026af7eb475ac11.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_12994150016af7eb56abb50.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/07_12994150016af7eb56abb50.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_17444953996af7eb5d2e152.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/08_17444953996af7eb5d2e152.jpg\" width=\"807\"/></a></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_4289599946af7eb6dc058a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/09_4289599946af7eb6dc058a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_2212274416af7eb9241724.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/11_2212274416af7eb9241724.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_3680660156af7eba1b02f4.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/12_3680660156af7eba1b02f4.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_6264125066af7eba9d317e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/13_6264125066af7eba9d317e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T13:25:41.179645+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1018,"images":12,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T13:00:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T15:43:17.405728+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T13:19:03.624357+00:00","content_hash":"bb880a4c12d955ed4ab02673beaf070383ed8c1da64bd9dd4e21a888ff2c357c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}